WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.700
Strong video updates follow a recipe. Practice it once before you record — you will sound prepared,

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.840
not rehearsed. Open with the customer's name and your name.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:14.300
Identify the vehicle and the service. Then point the camera at what you are explaining — let them

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.400
see the worn part, the leak, the measurement.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:18.720
And always close with a clear next step.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.780
"I will call you this afternoon at three" is a next step.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:24.672
"Call us back" is not. Give them something to do.
